{'symbol': 'ETN', 'date': '2023-03-14 14:00:00', 'title': "EATON NAMED ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES FOR THE 12TH TIME BY THE ETHISPHERE INSTITUTE", 'text': "CLEVELAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTELLIGENT POWER MANAGEMENT COMPANY EATON (NYSE:ETN) HAS AGAIN BEEN RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST ETHICAL COMPANIES IN 2023. THE LATEST DATA AND RANKING COME FROM ETHISPHERE, A GLOBAL LEADER IN DEFINING AND ADVANCING THE STANDARDS OF ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES. “WHEN WE LEAD WITH INTEGRITY AND DO BUSINESS RIGHT, WE WIN,” SAID JOE RODGERS, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL ETHICS AND COMPLIANCE. “THIS RECOGNITION REFLECTS THAT WE LIVE OUR VALUES EVERY DAY."}